  type_object_init_err_init_result.pcpp - break step of type_object_init.pcpp:
  an init with a result type (PR0059)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_init_err_init_result.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_init_err_init_result.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
